### 1. GET /app/books -> listar todos
GET http://localhost:8000/app/books

### 2. GET /app/books?autor=Orwell -> filtro por autor (clase 4, sigue andando)
GET http://localhost:8000/app/books?autor=Orwell

### 3. GET /app/books?page=1&limit=2 -> paginado: solo 2 resultados
GET http://localhost:8000/app/books?page=1&limit=2

### 4. GET /app/books?sort=-stock -> orden descendente por stock
GET http://localhost:8000/app/books?sort=-stock

### 5. GET /app/books?sort=titulo -> orden ascendente por título
GET http://localhost:8000/app/books?sort=titulo

### 6. GET /app/books/1 -> existe (200)
GET http://localhost:8000/app/books/1

### 7. GET /app/books/999 -> no existe: formato de error estandarizado (404)
GET http://localhost:8000/app/books/999

### 8. POST /app/books -> crear válido (201)
POST http://localhost:8000/app/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbn": "9788437604945",
  "titulo": "Ficciones",
  "autor": "ovaldo ojeda",
  "stock": 4
}

### 9. POST /app/books -> sin título: error estandarizado (400)
POST http://localhost:8000/app/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "autor": "Autor Anónimo"
}

### 10. PUT /app/books/1 -> actualizar (200)
PUT http://localhost:8000/app/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Cien años de soledad (Edición Especial)",
  "stock": 10
}

### 11. DELETE /app/books/2 -> eliminar (200)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/app/books/2

### 12. GET /cualquier-cosa -> notFound middleware: 404 estandarizado
GET http://localhost:8000/cualquier-cosa

### 13. GET /app/books -> estado final
GET http://localhost:8000/app/books
